## Verdict

`FAIL`, with a useful partial pass.

What passed:

- Grid2D -> RT export still works with `RenderGridToRenderTarget = DirectSet / TwoD / NumThreads [512,512,1]`.
- Custom HLSL on `AdvectGrid.StackContext.RGBA` writes to the RT.
- `SamplePreviousGrid(Unit - DeltaUV)` visibly reprojects existing data in +X.

What failed:

- Entering-edge zero-fill did not pass. In this run, the seed gate stayed active after runtime `User.V4_SeedEnabled` was set to 0.
- This is scoped to the V4 graph wiring plus SIE/advance harness used here; it is not proof that UE 5.6.1 runtime scalar User parameters cannot reach GPU sim stages.
- Therefore hold+reprojection is still not approved for Ground sleep/window movement.

